### ============================================================================
### Dexpert (PayPlatter) Encrypted Payment Webhook - Local Test Requests
### Local Server: http://localhost:5000
### Production Server: https://admin.freshwayz.dexpertsystems.com
### ============================================================================

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Test Unencrypted transId Rejection (Loophole Closed)
### Expected outcome: "encrypted_query_required" (Rejected! Won't mark SUCCESS)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments/webhook/dexpert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transId": "TXNF85F7B1FA9AA"
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Test Invalid Ciphertext
### Expected outcome: "decryption_failed" (Rejected safely without modifying DB)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments/webhook/dexpert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "INVALID_ENCRYPTED_DATA_ABC123",
  "mcode": "MYA344"
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
