}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Test GET Webhook Callback (Sample shared by Dexpert)
### Generate query using: node generate-test-payload.js <YOUR_TXN_ID> <AMOUNT> SUCCESS
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET http://localhost:5000/api/payments/webhook/dexpert?mcode=MYA344&transDate=02-11-2026%2012:00:00&query=PASTE_ENCRYPTED_QUERY_HERE


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Test POST Webhook Callback (Real Encrypted Payment Success)
### Expected outcome: "updated" -> status: SUCCESS, receiptNumber generated
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments/webhook/dexpert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "PASTE_ENCRYPTED_QUERY_HERE",
  "mcode": "MYA344",
  "transDate": "02-11-2026 12:00:00"
}
